.SH "نام (NAME)"
checkpto \- Helper program for Hugin\*(Aqs assistant
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.IX Header "SYNOPSIS"
\&\fBcheckpto\fR \fIinput.pto\fR
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.IX Header "DESCRIPTION"
\&\fBcheckpto\fR examines the connections between images in a project and
reports back the number of parts or image groups in that project
.PP
\&\fBcheckpto\fR is used by the assistant when creating a new project.
.SH "FURTHER SWITCHES"
.IX Header "FURTHER SWITCHES"
.IP \fB\-\-print\-output\-info\fR 4
.IX Item "--print-output-info"
Print more information about the output
.IP \fB\-\-print\-lens\-info\fR 4
.IX Item "--print-lens-info"
Print more information about the lenses in the project
.IP \fB\-\-print\-stack\-info\fR 4
.IX Item "--print-stack-info"
Print more information about assigned stacks in the project
.IP \fB\-\-print\-image\-info\fR 4
.IX Item "--print-image-info"
Print more information about images in the project
.IP \fB\-\-create\-missing\-images\fR 4
.IX Item "--create-missing-images"
Creates placeholder images for non\-existing images in the same directory as the pto file
.SH "نویسندگان (AUTHORS)"
